        "id": 1478788
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-06-02T09:44:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ok so if I read this right the right thing to do is to have a different configuration for `gpio_usb_c1_rt_int_odl` pin that sets it as input, probably also `gpio_usb_c1_rt_rst_r_odl` and `gpio_usb_c1_rst_odl`? Maybe you can flag them as no-auto-init and let the pull-up/down on the device drive them to a known state? (and initialize them manually in the non-anx case)",
      "parentUuid": "705f3f34_d5ceecaf",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 79,
        "startChar": 43,
        "endLine": 79,
        "endChar": 62
      },
      "revId": "b4b5bf9f6bd6a9c8962712a1745895a74e95cb27",
